interesting. In theory this should work (see also 
http://sourceforge.net/projects/rkward/forums/forum/165574/topic/3692612). 
Could you try running this on the command line (cmd.exe)? That might show an 
error message to help us track this down.

> how do i make RKward available for other users on the same machine ?

The installer is not smart enough to figure out, whether it has administrator 
privileges, and therefore it just installs a shortcut on the current user's 
desktop. You could simply copy RKWard.lnk from the Administrator's desktop to 
the desktop-folder below "All Users".

