The following forum message was posted by tfry at http://sourceforge.net/projects/rkward/forums/forum/165574/topic/3692612:

[quote]Can I try the new installation bundle without removing my precedent installation (in case I get into troubles I could go back to my previous install)?[/quote]

Yes. As long as you install to a different directory, your previous installation will remain unaffected. But note: Any settings you make in RKWard or another KDE application will hold for both KDE installations, but only on the same machine (these settings are stored in your windows home directory).



